# The v1 baseline models (ml/artifacts/*_v1.{pkl,sha256}) ARE committed on purpose — a fresh
# deploy has no training step, and without them nodes fall back to rule-only classification
# (still fully functional, just less impressive for a demo). Only later/OTA-pushed versions and
# the bulky generated training dataset are ignored.
ml/artifacts/*_v[2-9]*.pkl
ml/artifacts/*_v[2-9]*.sha256
training/datasets/
